{"seq":3,"slug":"crafting-skill","title":"合成熟练度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-crafting-systems/progression/crafting-skill","wordCount":1404,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"合成熟练度\">合成熟练度</h1><p>同一条打铁配方，一个刚入门的学徒和一位打了千把剑的大师做出来，不该是一样的东西。<strong>熟练度</strong>（crafting skill / proficiency）就是让「重复劳动本身产生成长」的系统：每一次合成都给玩家的这门手艺积累经验，熟练度越高，成功率越稳、品质越好、材料越省。它把<a href=\"../recipes/output-quality\">产出与随机品质</a>里那个纯靠运气的品质 roll，变成了一条玩家可以通过努力持续左右的曲线。这一篇专讲熟练度的曲线、收益与设计陷阱。它是<a href=\"crafting-unlocks\">解锁</a>之后的第三道成长门槛——解锁管「能造」，熟练度管「造得好」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-熟练度带来什么\">核心概念：熟练度带来什么</h2><p>熟练度必须转化为<strong>看得见的收益</strong>，否则玩家没有反复练的动力。常见收益有四类，一个系统通常挑几样组合：</p>\n<p><strong>成功率提升</strong>：如果系统有合成失败机制，熟练度降低失败概率。学徒炼钢常失败，大师几乎必成。</p>\n<p><strong>品质加成</strong>：熟练度直接给产物品质一个正向偏移，即<a href=\"../recipes/output-quality\">产出与随机品质</a>公式里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>skill</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_{\\text{skill}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">skill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这是最核心的收益——让熟练的玩家稳定产出更好的东西。</p>\n<p><strong>材料节省</strong>：一定概率返还部分材料，或降低配方消耗。这直接改善合成的经济效率，是老玩家的重要利润来源。</p>\n<p><strong>大成功概率</strong>：提高触发「暴击合成」的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>crit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{crit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">crit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，让熟练玩家更常打出惊喜产物。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>收益类型</th>\n<th>作用于</th>\n<th>玩家感知</th>\n<th>需注意</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成功率提升</td>\n<td>失败判定</td>\n<td>少交学费</td>\n<td>满级不应 100% 否则失去张力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品质加成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>skill</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_{\\text{skill}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">skill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>品质公式</td>\n<td>稳定出好货</td>\n<td>加成上限防碾压低练玩家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>材料节省</td>\n<td>经济效率</td>\n<td>越练越省钱</td>\n<td>直接影响经济,需与水槽同调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大成功概率</td>\n<td>暴击判定</td>\n<td>惊喜更频繁</td>\n<td>与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>cap</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{cap}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上限协同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"经验曲线的设计\">经验曲线的设计</h2><p>熟练度靠积累经验升级，而<strong>经验曲线</strong>决定了成长的手感——升得太快则深度不足，太慢则枯燥。核心问题是：升到第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 级需要多少累计经验？</p>\n<p>最常见的是<strong>多项式或指数增长曲线</strong>。设升到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 级所需累计经验为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，一个典型的多项式模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(L) = a \\cdot L^{k}, \\qquad k \\in [1.5, 2.5]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0935em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，后期升级越陡峭，越能拉长高级玩家的追求。与此对偶，每次合成给的经验也要设计：低级配方给的经验应随玩家等级衰减（否则玩家会靠反复刷最廉价配方无脑冲级），常见做法是当配方等级远低于玩家熟练度时经验大幅递减，逼玩家去做与自己水平相称的配方。这类数值曲线的通用建模，与经济平衡的数值曲线同源，见<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/foundations/number-systems-curves\">游戏经济的数值系统与曲线</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[完成一次合成] --&gt; B[按配方难度给经验]&#10;  B --&gt; C{配方等级 vs 熟练度}&#10;  C --&gt;|配方远低于熟练度| D[经验大幅衰减&lt;br/&gt;防刷低级冲级]&#10;  C --&gt;|配方与熟练度相称| E[全额经验]&#10;  D --&gt; F[累计经验 += 经验值]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{达到 E-L 阈值?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[熟练度升级&lt;br/&gt;成功率/品质/节省 提升]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[继续积累]\">flowchart TD\n  A[完成一次合成] --&gt; B[按配方难度给经验]\n  B --&gt; C{配方等级 vs 熟练度}\n  C --&gt;|配方远低于熟练度| D[经验大幅衰减&lt;br/&gt;防刷低级冲级]\n  C --&gt;|配方与熟练度相称| E[全额经验]\n  D --&gt; F[累计经验 += 经验值]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{达到 E-L 阈值?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[熟练度升级&lt;br/&gt;成功率/品质/节省 提升]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[继续积累]</pre><h2 id=\"反刷子与投入正当性\">反刷子与投入正当性</h2><p>熟练度系统最大的敌人是<strong>无意义的刷取</strong>。如果玩家能靠反复合成最廉价的物品（成本近乎零）来冲满熟练度，那熟练度就和真正的「精进手艺」脱钩了，变成一个枯燥的进度条。前面提到的「低级配方经验衰减」是第一道防线，另一道是让经验与<strong>材料成本</strong>挂钩——练手艺本身要消耗真材料，冲级于是有了经济代价，不再是零成本。</p>\n<p>这就把熟练度和经济绑到了一起：练级消耗的材料是一个真实的水槽。设计时必须和<a href=\"../practice/crafting-economy\">合成与经济平衡</a>一起考虑，否则要么冲级太廉价（熟练度贬值），要么太昂贵（劝退新手）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"熟练度与专精-留存\">熟练度与专精、留存</h2><p>熟练度天然导向<strong>专精</strong>：因为练满一门手艺代价高昂，玩家往往只精通一两门，其余靠交易解决。这在多人游戏里催生了「大师铁匠」这样的身份和玩家间分工——一个熟练度满级的玩家，其产物在市场上有溢价，这本身就是强留存动力。专精带来的玩家分工与市场，属于经济系统的宏观议题，详见<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/economy/trading-markets\">游戏经济的交易与市场</a>。</p>\n<p>从留存角度，熟练度提供了一条「重复但不无聊」的长期曲线：即使玩家已经解锁了所有配方（解锁到顶），熟练度仍在缓慢爬升，仍有「把这门手艺练到极致」的目标。这让合成系统在内容耗尽之后依然有留存力，正是<a href=\"../foundations/why-crafting\">为何需要合成系统</a>里说的留存价值的具体落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>熟练度让重复合成本身产生成长，把纯运气的品质 roll 变成可努力左右的曲线。</li>\n<li>收益有四类：成功率、品质加成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>skill</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_{\\text{skill}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">skill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、材料节省、大成功概率；需组合且都要设上限防碾压。</li>\n<li>经验曲线常用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(L)=a L^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；低级配方经验随熟练度衰减，防无脑刷低级冲级。</li>\n<li>反刷子靠经验衰减 + 经验与材料成本挂钩，练级于是有真实经济代价，与经济系统同调。</li>\n<li>熟练度导向专精与市场分工，并在内容耗尽后提供长期留存曲线。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../recipes/output-quality\">产出与随机品质</a>——熟练度加成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>skill</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_{\\text{skill}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">skill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 注入品质公式之处。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../practice/crafting-economy\">合成与经济平衡</a>——练级消耗作为经济水槽。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/foundations/number-systems-curves\">游戏经济 · 数值系统与曲线</a>——经验曲线的通用建模。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/economy/trading-markets\">游戏经济 · 交易与市场</a>——专精催生的玩家间市场分工。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合成熟练度","id":"合成熟练度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：熟练度带来什么","id":"核心概念-熟练度带来什么"},{"level":2,"text":"经验曲线的设计","id":"经验曲线的设计"},{"level":2,"text":"反刷子与投入正当性","id":"反刷子与投入正当性"},{"level":2,"text":"熟练度与专精、留存","id":"熟练度与专精-留存"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"解锁与技能树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-crafting-systems/progression/crafting-unlocks"},"next":{"title":"合成与经济平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-crafting-systems/practice/crafting-economy"}}